(will be entertained after the expiry of the stipulated time.) Tj
0.00 -12.00 TD
(2. The withheld student must have to clear their withheld status within 06 May, 2026, otherwise they will not get admit card for next examination. After clearing the withheld status the overall result of the) Tj
